  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gal 301.09 “Telephone number of the applicant’s guardian ad litem business” means the telephone number which the guardian ad litem uses in connection with his or her work as a guardian ad litem.\n\nSource. #12010, eff 10-21-16 (from Gal 301.08)",
